#Ask the user for a temperature in celcius (string input).
#convert it into float , then calculate 
#and print temperture in fahrenheit
#conversion formula : fahrenheitTemp = (CelciusTemp *(9/5))+32.
user_input = input("enter a temperature in Celcius:")
Celcius_Temp= float(user_input)
fahrenheit_Temp = (Celcius_Temp*(9/5))+32
print("temperature in fahrenheit", fahrenheit_Temp)